{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-3-1-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_3_1_2_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"known_evidence_ids\": [],\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_3_1_2_1:p1\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"目标人群（估计目标属性一）为成人慢性鼻窦炎伴鼻息肉患者；研究允许在稳定背景下使用鼻用糖皮质激素，并对背景治疗进行记录。该目标人群是估计目标所指向的患者群体，其定义应独立于随机化和分析集划分。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"block:v2_n_3_1_2_1:p2\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"目标人群与随机后分析集应明确区分。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），遵循意向性治疗（ITT）原则，包括随机化受试者，并按随机分组进行分析；FAS 是用于主要分析的随机后分析集，并不等同于目标人群本身，也不能将目标人群默认等同于 FAS 或“至少一次给药”人群。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"40dbe6fd8c96219ea8c32d88adef001ff7c47e94e4fbd61b54b6d4954763d0a5"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:8de338482b7b91f7e615f1e60dd98b3892f7d8a0758f802f07746d1a43b32690:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:8de338482b7b91f7e615f1e60dd98b3892f7d8a0758f802f07746d1a43b32690:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"915d65ca2e666279feeaa9ed97fdc24c97d44253626af383c70f4dc28f85cfa1","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"17db00b5-1c6e-4fbb-b150-a9928f73742a","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}